// expect: same: a|o|x|ab|os|xs|av: 0|15|11|524288|7|3|k1
// expect: same: k|a|o|x|xb|n: k0|0|62|14|2417761602|487;k1|1|63|50|322872230|486;k2|0|62|42|686664294|486;k3|1|63|14|998534442|486;k4|0|62|52|2409718980|487;k5|1|63|9|1932537155|487;|0|63|29|4263281503|81
// expect: same: a|o|x|v: |||
// expect: same: a|b|c: 0|0|63
